# Top K Frequent Elements

Approach

Step 1
Count the frequency of each element using unordered_map.

Step 2
Copy unordered_map into vector<pair<int,int>>.
Reason: unordered_map cannot be sorted.

Step 3
Sort the vector in descending order of frequency.

Step 4
Take the first k elements using v[i].first.

Time Complexity
O(n + m log m)

Worst Case
O(n log n)

Space Complexity
O(m)